    ontoksd:hasInstructionalStatement "Read a side count of 3, 4 or 5 and a positive side length in centimeters. Display TRIANGLE and its equilateral area for 3, SQUARE and its area for 4, and only PENTAGON for 5."@en,
        "Submit source code. Running the examples and comparing actual and expected results is optional."@en,
        "Use the supplied formulas A = (sqrt(3)/4) * l^2 and A = l^2. Preserve fractional results and display areas in square centimeters; no fixed decimal formatting is required."@en ;
